WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:03.250
I'm Adrian Funkey.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.650
I started Thornbird in 2011,

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:10.050
after my time as Chief Executive
of Grand Parade Investments.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.450
That time, I had one aim:

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.340
to give growing businesses the finance,
strategy and system support

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.700
that usually only big companies can afford.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.200
Since then, we've helped owners
move their books onto the cloud,

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:24.100
planned their tax before the transaction,

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.300
and turned their numbers
into a plan that they can act on.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.450
I kept on seeing the same problem, though.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.350
Owner-run businesses clearly needing
my kind of CFO thinking,

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:37.450
but a fractional CFO at 15,000 rand a day
was just out of reach.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.000
Those small businesses
are the ones that create jobs,

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.100
in a country where most young people
can't find work. That's crucially important,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:48.100
something that keeps me awake at night,
with four young children.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.100
That's why we built Finertecture:

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.500
CFO support by subscription,

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.900
priced for small businesses, so they get
the thinking they need, when they need it.

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.200
Thornbird is a family business.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.950
My wife Nada keeps the business side
running smoothly,

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:05.100
and Sasa, Aleks and Zoran
have worked with me since 2025.

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:07.050
They're the team you'll be working with.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.100
Our youngest is Tijana.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.100
She's our creative spark.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.800
She even came up with the name Finertecture.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.600
If that sounds like what your business needs,

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:20.500
book a call at thornbird97.com.
